        <body>
            <div xml:id="d569">

                <pb facs="0696" n="588" xml:id="pg588"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-10-14"><hi rendition="#italic">October 14, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received October 27.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No 43.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Since my No. 40, touching the Caroline
                    incident, I have received from Señor Moret a reply to my note of the 18th of
                    August, a translation of which I inclose herein. Awaiting your commands,</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hannis Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d569-a1.xml" xpointer="d569-a1"/>
